# `.5em` is `Dot UnitLit` (only `-.5em` is one number in style mode, grammar.md 4.4). The
# missing member name gets a fix that writes the leading zero.
error[K0100] 3:23-3:26: expected a member name, found `5em`
  help: a number needs a digit before the `.`: write `0.5em`
  fix "Write `0.5em`"
    edit 3:22-3:22 "0"
